hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1776","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ne farmaya: Aadam ka beta mujhey takleef deta hai. Wo zamana ko gaali deta hai. Jabke main zamana hun. Merey haath mein muamla hai. Main raat aur din ko palat-ta hun. (Bukhari: 4826). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Phir jab unhon-ne use baadal dekha jo unki waadiyon ki taraf aata tha) aayat."
